## 7. Feature Branch Naming (Enforced)

**Rule:** All feature branches follow `cursor/<descriptive-name>-a457`.

**Pattern:**
- Prefix: `cursor/`
- Name: lowercase, hyphens, descriptive
- Suffix: `-a457`

**Examples:**
- ✅ `cursor/add-lss-schedule-a457`
- ✅ `cursor/fix-cw-blackout-dates-a457`
- ❌ `fix-bug` (missing prefix/suffix)
- ❌ `cursor/Fix-Bug-a457` (uppercase)

**Enforcement:**
- Git hook rejects branches without proper naming (future)
- PR tool checks branch name before creation (current)

