## 13. Deployment Awareness

**Rule:** Code must work in production environment (Vercel + Railway).

**Checks before PR:**
- [ ] No hardcoded `localhost` URLs (use env vars)
- [ ] Environment variables documented in PR
- [ ] Build succeeds (`npm run build`)
- [ ] No dev-only dependencies in production code
- [ ] Secrets never committed (`.env` in `.gitignore`)

**Vercel Frontend:**
- Build command: `npm run build`
- Output: `.next`
- Root: `frontend/`
- Auto-deploy on `main` merge

**Railway Backend:**
- Start command: `npm run start:prod` (includes `prisma migrate deploy`)
- Auto-deploy on `main` merge
- Health check: `GET /health` (must exist and return 200)

