5. Security rigor (for auth/member/tenant)
6. Asia/Manila timezone (source of truth)
7. Branch naming (`cursor/<name>-a457`)
8. Commit quality (atomic, descriptive)
9. Docs vs code separation (clear)
10. ACR for Architecture conflicts (required)

**When in doubt:**
- Check `AGENTS.md`
- Check `docs/processes/ai-delivery-pipeline.md`
- Check `docs/architecture/<relevant>.md`
- Ask BLD Bot

**Never:**
